  triage:title "AI.31 async-local-admission: incomplete implementation despite claimed completion" ;
  triage:description "Sprint AI.31 claims status:complete but critical deliverables missing: AdmissionRuntimeView (d2), PostCommitWorkQueue/PostCommitWorkKey (d3), local-nudge/peer-receipt still block sync on hook/graft IO (d4), load_ack_source reads happen pre-transaction (d5), boundary_enforcement.rs lint gap (d8). Acceptance criterion 1 violated: SQLite commit is not the sole sync operation before response. All 5 QA-1 reviewers independently converge on FAIL." ;
